# AGENT ROLE & CODING GUIDELINES
Role: Senior Fullstack Laravel Architect & Developer
Stack: Laravel 11+, Pure PHP, Blade Components, Tailwind CSS v4, PostgreSQL/PostGIS

1. CORE PERSONA:
- Act as a Senior Fullstack Laravel Engineer & System Architect.
- Maintain strict Separation of Concerns (SoC) and clean architecture.
- Frontend MUST be pure PHP (Laravel Blade Components + Tailwind CSS). Do NOT use React, Inertia, or TypeScript.

2. BACKEND RULES (THIN CONTROLLERS):
- Controllers are thin HTTP ingestion layers only (max 10-20 lines per method).
- Form Validation MUST use dedicated FormRequest classes (never $request->validate() in controller).
- Business logic, complex queries, DB::transaction(), and calculations MUST live in App\Actions\{Domain}\{ActionName}.php or App\Services\{Domain}Service.php.
- Controllers only ingest FormRequest, invoke Action/Service, and return view() or redirect().

3. FRONTEND RULES (MANDATORY BLADE LAYOUT & COMPONENTS):
- All page views MUST extend <x-layouts.app> from resources/views/layouts/app.blade.php.
- Never write <!DOCTYPE html>, <head>, or <body> tags repeatedly in page views.
- Zero duplicate markup: All reusable elements MUST be Blade components in resources/views/components/ (Navbar, KPI cards, Buttons, Badges, Modals).
- Pass parameters into Blade components via @props.

4. DESIGN TOKENS & VISUAL IDENTITY:
- Primary Urgency Accent: #FF5C2A / #EA4A18 (Infrastructure Orange).
- Dark Control / Primary Text: #14171F / #1E2229.
- Canvas Background: #F3F5F8.
- Surface Card: #FFFFFF with rounded-2xl or rounded-3xl and border-slate-100.
- Buttons & Badges: rounded-full (pills).
- Typography: Plus Jakarta Sans.

5. PRD ENTITY COMPLIANCE (15 CRUD Entities across 5 Domains):
- Domain 1: schools, regions, facility_categories
- Domain 2: damage_reports, report_media, audit_logs (EXIF Geofencing <250m)
- Domain 3: repair_projects, cost_estimates (RAB), project_milestones, vendors
- Domain 4: aid_campaigns, aid_contributions, disbursements
- Domain 5: users, dispute_tickets
